# Symbols DEKOTOFUSOEM exports. This is the only list of exported names:
# CMake generates the Windows module definition file (dekotofusoem.def) and
# the GNU ld version script (dekotofusoem.map) from it at configure time.
#
# The JVM side resolves these names through jnr-ffi
# (DecoTofu/src/main/java/ken/mizoguch/soem/SoemLibrary.java), so a name here
# is an ABI: rename or remove one and DecoTofu stops loading. The first seven
# are implemented by dekotofusoem.c, the rest are SOEM functions that are
# linked statically into this library and re-exported.
#
# One symbol per line, order is preserved in the generated files.
#
ec_malloc_context
ec_free_context
ec_redport
ec_malloc_parcel
ec_free_parcel
